      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARGI JEAN (5) jumped from box 4 last time and ran away with an impressive win scoring by 4.5 lengths at this track in a handy 30.03. Will need some luck early after drawing a tricky box here. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Well placed and will be tough to beat. DID IT HAPPEN (1) was a course and distance winner (21.97) last time also from the same draw, scoring by a neck in a Grade 5. Expected to feature again. SPACE ZOOMER (4) found traffic in the run and collided, missing the frame when a 7 length eighth (28.27) at Mandurah in a Grade 4/5. Must include in calculations. SHOTGUN SEAT (2) won with authority last start. Hard to beat again.",
